[statement]
A `!` entry of a condition does not lead the walk: `ext`, triggered by
`a`, is placed before `q`, which its `!q<1` names at a version it does
not admit.

[repository]
P:a
V:1

P:q
V:2

P:zq
V:1
D:q

P:ext
V:1
i:a !q<1

[request]
a
zq

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install ext 1
install q 2
install zq 1
